    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A pilot virtual simulation project has been launched for undergraduate and graduate nursing students, in a step to tackle disruptions to in-person clinical teaching at SONAM. This has been with the support of the  International Nursing Association for Clinical Simulation and Learning. INACSL , a US-based body advancing standards of best practice in healthcare simulation.",
